msgid ""
"<h3>About Product Bundle</h3>\n"
"\n"
"<p>Aggregate group of <b>Items</b> into another <b>Item</b>. This is useful if you are bundling a certain <b>Items</b> into a package and you maintain stock of the packed <b>Items</b> and not the aggregate <b>Item</b>.</p>\n"
"<p>The package <b>Item</b> will have <code>Is Stock Item</code> as <b>No</b> and <code>Is Sales Item</code> as <b>Yes</b>.</p>\n"
"<h4>Example:</h4>\n"
"<p>If you are selling Laptops and Backpacks separately and have a special price if the customer buys both, then the Laptop + Backpack will be a new Product Bundle Item.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<h3>Apie prekių rinkinį</h3>\n"
"\n"
"<p>Sujunkite kelias <b>prekes</b> į kitą <b>prekę</b>. Tai naudinga, kai kelias <b>prekes</b> parduodate kaip rinkinį ir atsargas apskaitote pagal rinkinio <b>prekes</b> ir ne pagal bendrą <b>prekę</b>.</p>\n"
"<p>Rinkinio <b>prekės</b> laukas <code>Is Stock Item</code> bus <b>Ne</b> ir <code>Is Sales Item</code> bus <b>Taip</b>.</p>\n"
"<h4>Pavyzdys:</h4>\n"
"<p>Jei nešiojamuosius kompiuterius ir kuprines parduodate atskirai, bet kartu įsigyjantiems klientams taikote specialią kainą, nešiojamasis kompiuteris + kuprinė bus nauja prekių rinkinio prekė.</p>"

msgid ""
"<h3>Currency Exchange Settings Help</h3>\n"
"<p>There are 3 variables that could be used within the endpoint, result key and in values of the parameter.</p>\n"
"<p>Exchange rate between {from_currency} and {to_currency} on {transaction_date} is fetched by the API.</p>\n"
"<p>Example: If your endpoint is exchange.com/2021-08-01, then, you will have to input exchange.com/{transaction_date}</p>"
msgstr ""
"<h3>Valiutos kursų nustatymų pagalba</h3>\n"
"<p>Trys kintamieji gali būti naudojami API galinio taško adrese, rezultato rakte ir parametrų reikšmėse.</p>\n"
"<p>Valiutų {from_currency} ir {to_currency} kursas {transaction_date} dieną gaunamas per API.</p>\n"
"<p>Pavyzdys: jei galinio taško adresas yra exchange.com/2021-08-01, įveskite exchange.com/{transaction_date}</p>"

msgid ""
"<h3>Custom CSS Help</h3>\n"
"\n"
"<p>Notes:</p>\n"
"\n"
"<ol>\n"
"<li>All field groups (label + value) are set attributes <code>data-fieldtype</code> and <code>data-fieldname</code></li>\n"
"<li>All values are given class <code>value</code></li>\n"
"<li>All Section Breaks are given class <code>section-break</code></li>\n"
"<li>All Column Breaks are given class <code>column-break</code></li>\n"
"</ol>\n"
"\n"
"<h4>Examples</h4>\n"
"\n"
"<p>1. Left align integers</p>\n"
"\n"
"<pre><code>[data-fieldtype=\"Int\"] .value { text-align: left; }</code></pre>\n"
"\n"
"<p>1. Add border to sections except the last section</p>\n"
"\n"
"<pre><code>.section-break { padding: 30px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; }\n"
".section-break:last-child { padding-bottom: 0px; border-bottom: 0px;  }</code></pre>"
msgstr ""
"<h3>Pasirinktinio CSS žinynas</h3>\n"
"\n"
"<p>Pastabos:</p>\n"
"\n"
"<ol>\n"
"<li>Visoms laukų grupėms (etiketė + reikšmė) nustatyti atributai <code>data-fieldtype</code> ir <code>data-fieldname</code></li>\n"
"<li>Visoms reikšmėms priskirta klasė <code>value</code></li>\n"
"<li>Visiems skilties skirtukams priskirta klasė <code>section-break</code></li>\n"
"<li>Visiems stulpelio skirtukams priskirta klasė <code>column-break</code></li>\n"
"</ol>\n"
"\n"
"<h4>Pavyzdžiai</h4>\n"
"\n"
"<p>1. Lygiuoti sveikuosius skaičius kairėje</p>\n"
"\n"
"<pre><code>[data-fieldtype=\"Int\"] .value { text-align: left; }</code></pre>\n"
"\n"
"<p>1. Pridėti kraštinę skiltims, išskyrus paskutinę</p>\n"
"\n"
"<pre><code>.section-break { padding: 30px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; }\n"
".section-break:last-child { padding-bottom: 0px; border-bottom: 0px;  }</code></pre>"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"<h3>Print Format Help</h3>\n"
"<hr>\n"
"<h4>Introduction</h4>\n"
"<p>Print Formats are rendered on the server side using the Jinja Templating Language. All forms have access to the <code>doc</code> object which contains information about the document that is being formatted. You can also access common utilities via the <code>frappe</code> module.</p>\n"
"<p>For styling, the Boostrap CSS framework is provided and you can enjoy the full range of classes.</p>\n"
"<hr>\n"
"<h4>References</h4>\n"
"<ol>\n"
"\t<li><a href=\"http://jinja.pocoo.org/docs/templates/\" target=\"_blank\">Jinja Templating Language</a></li>\n"
"\t<li><a href=\"http://getbootstrap.com\" target=\"_blank\">Bootstrap CSS Framework</a></li>\n"
"</ol>\n"
"<hr>\n"
"<h4>Example</h4>\n"
"<pre><code>&lt;h3&gt;{{ doc.select_print_heading or \"Invoice\" }}&lt;/h3&gt;\n"
"&lt;div class=\"row\"&gt;\n"
"\t&lt;div class=\"col-md-3 text-right\"&gt;Customer Name&lt;/div&gt;\n"
"\t&lt;div class=\"col-md-9\"&gt;{{ doc.customer_name }}&lt;/div&gt;\n"
"&lt;/div&gt;\n"
"&lt;div class=\"row\"&gt;\n"
"\t&lt;div class=\"col-md-3 text-right\"&gt;Date&lt;/div&gt;\n"
"\t&lt;div class=\"col-md-9\"&gt;{{ doc.get_formatted(\"invoice_date\") }}&lt;/div&gt;\n"
"&lt;/div&gt;\n"
"&lt;table class=\"table table-bordered\"&gt;\n"
"\t&lt;tbody&gt;\n"
"\t\t&lt;tr&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;th&gt;Sr&lt;/th&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;th&gt;Item Name&lt;/th&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;th&gt;Description&lt;/th&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;th class=\"text-right\"&gt;Qty&lt;/th&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;th class=\"text-right\"&gt;Rate&lt;/th&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;th class=\"text-right\"&gt;Amount&lt;/th&gt;\n"
"\t\t&lt;/tr&gt;\n"
"\t\t{%- for row in doc.items -%}\n"
"\t\t&lt;tr&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;td style=\"width: 3%;\"&gt;{{ row.idx }}&lt;/td&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;td style=\"width: 20%;\"&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t\t{{ row.item_name }}\n"
"\t\t\t\t{% if row.item_code != row.item_name -%}\n"
"\t\t\t\t&lt;br&gt;Item Code: {{ row.item_code}}\n"
"\t\t\t\t{%- endif %}\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;/td&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;td style=\"width: 37%;\"&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t\t&lt;div style=\"border: 0px;\"&gt;{{ row.description }}&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;td style=\"width: 10%; text-align: right;\"&gt;{{ row.qty }} {{ row.uom or row.stock_uom }}&lt;/td&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;td style=\"width: 15%; text-align: right;\"&gt;{{\n"
"\t\t\t\trow.get_formatted(\"rate\", doc) }}&lt;/td&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;td style=\"width: 15%; text-align: right;\"&gt;{{\n"
"\t\t\t\trow.get_formatted(\"amount\", doc) }}&lt;/td&gt;\n"
"\t\t&lt;/tr&gt;\n"
"\t\t{%- endfor -%}\n"
"\t&lt;/tbody&gt;\n"
"&lt;/table&gt;</code></pre>\n"
"<hr>\n"
"<h4>Common Functions</h4>\n"
"<table class=\"table table-bordered\">\n"
"\t<tbody>\n"
"\t\t<tr>\n"
"\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 30%;\"><code>doc.get_formatted(\"[fieldname]\", [parent_doc])</code></td>\n"
"\t\t\t<td>Get document value formatted as Date, Currency, etc. Pass parent <code>doc</code> for currency type fields.</td>\n"
"\t\t</tr>\n"
"\t\t<tr>\n"
"\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 30%;\"><code>frappe.db.get_value(\"[doctype]\", \"[name]\", \"fieldname\")</code></td>\n"
"\t\t\t<td>Get value from another document.</td>\n"
"\t\t</tr>\n"
"\t</tbody>\n"
"</table>"
msgstr ""
"<h3>Spausdinimo formato žinynas</h3>\n"
"<hr>\n"
"<h4>Įvadas</h4>\n"
"<p>Spausdinimo formatai generuojami serveryje naudojant Jinja šablonų kalbą. Visose formose pasiekiamas <code>doc</code> objektas, kuriame yra informacija apie formatuojamą dokumentą. Bendrąsias pagalbines funkcijas taip pat galite pasiekti per <code>frappe</code> modulį.</p>\n"
"<p>Stiliui nustatyti galima naudoti Bootstrap CSS karkasą ir visas jo klases.</p>\n"
"<hr>\n"
"<h4>Nuorodos</h4>\n"
"<ol>\n"
"\t<li><a href=\"http://jinja.pocoo.org/docs/templates/\" target=\"_blank\">Jinja šablonų kalba</a></li>\n"
"\t<li><a href=\"http://getbootstrap.com\" target=\"_blank\">Bootstrap CSS karkasas</a></li>\n"
"</ol>\n"
"<hr>\n"
"<h4>Pavyzdys</h4>\n"
"<pre><code>&lt;h3&gt;{{ doc.select_print_heading or \"Invoice\" }}&lt;/h3&gt;\n"
"&lt;div class=\"row\"&gt;\n"
"\t&lt;div class=\"col-md-3 text-right\"&gt;Kliento pavadinimas&lt;/div&gt;\n"
"\t&lt;div class=\"col-md-9\"&gt;{{ doc.customer_name }}&lt;/div&gt;\n"
"&lt;/div&gt;\n"
"&lt;div class=\"row\"&gt;\n"
"\t&lt;div class=\"col-md-3 text-right\"&gt;Data&lt;/div&gt;\n"
"\t&lt;div class=\"col-md-9\"&gt;{{ doc.get_formatted(\"invoice_date\") }}&lt;/div&gt;\n"
"&lt;/div&gt;\n"
"&lt;table class=\"table table-bordered\"&gt;\n"
"\t&lt;tbody&gt;\n"
"\t\t&lt;tr&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;th&gt;Nr.&lt;/th&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;th&gt;Prekės pavadinimas&lt;/th&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;th&gt;Aprašymas&lt;/th&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;th class=\"text-right\"&gt;Kiekis&lt;/th&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;th class=\"text-right\"&gt;Vieneto kaina&lt;/th&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;th class=\"text-right\"&gt;Suma&lt;/th&gt;\n"
"\t\t&lt;/tr&gt;\n"
"\t\t{%- for row in doc.items -%}\n"
"\t\t&lt;tr&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;td style=\"width: 3%;\"&gt;{{ row.idx }}&lt;/td&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;td style=\"width: 20%;\"&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t\t{{ row.item_name }}\n"
"\t\t\t\t{% if row.item_code != row.item_name -%}\n"
"\t\t\t\t&lt;br&gt;Prekės kodas: {{ row.item_code}}\n"
"\t\t\t\t{%- endif %}\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;/td&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;td style=\"width: 37%;\"&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t\t&lt;div style=\"border: 0px;\"&gt;{{ row.description }}&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;td style=\"width: 10%; text-align: right;\"&gt;{{ row.qty }} {{ row.uom or row.stock_uom }}&lt;/td&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;td style=\"width: 15%; text-align: right;\"&gt;{{\n"
"\t\t\t\trow.get_formatted(\"rate\", doc) }}&lt;/td&gt;\n"
"\t\t\t&lt;td style=\"width: 15%; text-align: right;\"&gt;{{\n"
"\t\t\t\trow.get_formatted(\"amount\", doc) }}&lt;/td&gt;\n"
"\t\t&lt;/tr&gt;\n"
"\t\t{%- endfor -%}\n"
"\t&lt;/tbody&gt;\n"
"&lt;/table&gt;</code></pre>\n"
"<hr>\n"
"<h4>Dažniausiai naudojamos funkcijos</h4>\n"
"<table class=\"table table-bordered\">\n"
"\t<tbody>\n"
"\t\t<tr>\n"
"\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 30%;\"><code>doc.get_formatted(\"[fieldname]\", [parent_doc])</code></td>\n"
"\t\t\t<td>Gaukite dokumento reikšmę, suformatuotą kaip datą, valiutą ir pan. Perduokite pirminį <code>doc</code> valiutos tipo laukams.</td>\n"
"\t\t</tr>\n"
"\t\t<tr>\n"
"\t\t\t<td style=\"width: 30%;\"><code>frappe.db.get_value(\"[doctype]\", \"[name]\", \"fieldname\")</code></td>\n"
"\t\t\t<td>Gaukite reikšmę iš kito dokumento.</td>\n"
"\t\t</tr>\n"
"\t</tbody>\n"
"</table>"

msgid ""
"<h4>Body Text and Closing Text Example</h4>\n"
"\n"
"<div>We have noticed that you have not yet paid invoice {{sales_invoice}} for {{frappe.db.get_value(\"Currency\", currency, \"symbol\")}} {{outstanding_amount}}. This is a friendly reminder that the invoice was due on {{due_date}}. Please pay the amount due immediately to avoid any further dunning cost.</div>\n"
"\n"
"<h4>How to get fieldnames</h4>\n"
"\n"
"<p>The fieldnames you can use in your template are the fields in the document. You can find out the fields of any documents via Setup &gt; Customize Form View and selecting the document type (e.g. Sales Invoice)</p>\n"
"\n"
"<h4>Templating</h4>\n"
"\n"
"<p>Templates are compiled using the Jinja Templating Language. To learn more about Jinja, <a class=\"strong\" href=\"http://jinja.pocoo.org/docs/dev/templates/\">read this documentation.</a></p>"
msgstr ""
"<h4>Turinio ir baigiamojo teksto pavyzdys</h4>\n"
"\n"
"<div>Pastebėjome, kad dar neapmokėjote sąskaitos faktūros {{sales_invoice}}, kurios neapmokėta suma yra {{frappe.db.get_value(\"Currency\", currency, \"symbol\")}} {{outstanding_amount}}. Primename, kad sąskaitos faktūros apmokėjimo terminas buvo {{due_date}}. Prašome nedelsiant sumokėti mokėtiną sumą, kad išvengtumėte papildomų skolos išieškojimo išlaidų.</div>\n"
"\n"
"<h4>Kaip rasti laukų pavadinimus</h4>\n"
"\n"
"<p>Šablone galite naudoti dokumento laukų pavadinimus. Bet kurio dokumento laukus rasite pasirinkę dokumento tipą (pvz., Pardavimo sąskaita faktūra) per Nustatymai &gt; Tinkinti formos rodinį</p>\n"
"\n"
"<h4>Šablonų naudojimas</h4>\n"
"\n"
"<p>Šablonai apdorojami Jinja šablonų kalba. Daugiau apie Jinja galite sužinoti <a class=\"strong\" href=\"http://jinja.pocoo.org/docs/dev/templates/\">perskaitę dokumentaciją.</a></p>"

msgid ""
"<h4>Contract Template Example</h4>\n"
"\n"
"<pre>Contract for Customer {{ party_name }}\n"
"\n"
"-Valid From : {{ start_date }} \n"
"-Valid To : {{ end_date }}\n"
"</pre>\n"
"\n"
"<h4>How to get fieldnames</h4>\n"
"\n"
"<p>The field names you can use in your Contract Template are the fields in the Contract for which you are creating the template. You can find out the fields of any documents via Setup &gt; Customize Form View and selecting the document type (e.g. Contract)</p>\n"
"\n"
"<h4>Templating</h4>\n"
"\n"
"<p>Templates are compiled using the Jinja Templating Language. To learn more about Jinja, <a class=\"strong\" href=\"http://jinja.pocoo.org/docs/dev/templates/\">read this documentation.</a></p>"
msgstr ""
"<h4>Sutarties šablono pavyzdys</h4>\n"
"\n"
"<pre>Sutartis su klientu {{ party_name }}\n"
"\n"
"-Galioja nuo : {{ start_date }} \n"
"-Galioja iki : {{ end_date }}\n"
"</pre>\n"
"\n"
"<h4>Kaip rasti laukų pavadinimus</h4>\n"
"\n"
"<p>Sutarties šablone galite naudoti tos sutarties, kuriai kuriate šabloną, laukus. Bet kurio dokumento laukus rasite pasirinkę dokumento tipą (pvz., Sutartis) per Nustatymai &gt; Tinkinti formos rodinį</p>\n"
"\n"
"<h4>Šablonų naudojimas</h4>\n"
"\n"
"<p>Šablonai apdorojami Jinja šablonų kalba. Daugiau apie Jinja galite sužinoti <a class=\"strong\" href=\"http://jinja.pocoo.org/docs/dev/templates/\">perskaitę dokumentaciją.</a></p>"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"<h4>Default Template</h4>\n"
"<p>Uses <a href=\"http://jinja.pocoo.org/docs/templates/\">Jinja Templating</a> and all the fields of Address (including Custom Fields if any) will be available</p>\n"
"<pre><code>{{ address_line1 }}&lt;br&gt;\n"
"{% if address_line2 %}{{ address_line2 }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n"
"{{ city }}&lt;br&gt;\n"
"{% if state %}{{ state }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n"
"{% if pincode %} PIN:  {{ pincode }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n"
"{{ country }}&lt;br&gt;\n"
"{% if phone %}Phone: {{ phone }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n"
"{% if fax %}Fax: {{ fax }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n"
"{% if email_id %}Email: {{ email_id }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n"
"</code></pre>"
msgstr ""
"<h4>Numatytasis šablonas</h4>\n"
"<p>Naudojama <a href=\"http://jinja.pocoo.org/docs/templates/\">Jinja šablonų kalba</a> ir pasiekiami visi adreso laukai (įskaitant pasirinktinius, jei jų yra)</p>\n"
"<pre><code>{{ address_line1 }}&lt;br&gt;\n"
"{% if address_line2 %}{{ address_line2 }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n"
"{{ city }}&lt;br&gt;\n"
"{% if state %}{{ state }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n"
"{% if pincode %} PIN:  {{ pincode }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n"
"{{ country }}&lt;br&gt;\n"
"{% if phone %}Telefonas: {{ phone }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n"
"{% if fax %}Faksas: {{ fax }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n"
"{% if email_id %}El. paštas: {{ email_id }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n"
"</code></pre>"

msgid ""
"<h4>Email Reply Example</h4>\n"
"\n"
"<pre>Order Overdue\n"
"\n"
"Transaction {{ name }} has exceeded Due Date. Please take necessary action.\n"
"\n"
"Details\n"
"\n"
"- Customer: {{ customer }}\n"
"- Amount: {{ grand_total }}\n"
"</pre>\n"
"\n"
"<h4>How to get fieldnames</h4>\n"
"\n"
"<p>The fieldnames you can use in your email template are the fields in the document from which you are sending the email. You can find out the fields of any documents via Setup &gt; Customize Form View and selecting the document type (e.g. Sales Invoice)</p>\n"
"\n"
"<h4>Templating</h4>\n"
"\n"
"<p>Templates are compiled using the Jinja Templating Language. To learn more about Jinja, <a class=\"strong\" href=\"http://jinja.pocoo.org/docs/dev/templates/\">read this documentation.</a></p>"
msgstr ""
"<h4>El. laiško atsakymo pavyzdys</h4>\n"
"\n"
"<pre>Pradelstas užsakymas\n"
"\n"
"Baigėsi operacijos {{ name }} terminas. Prašome imtis reikiamų veiksmų.\n"
"\n"
"Išsami informacija\n"
"\n"
"- Klientas: {{ customer }}\n"
"- Suma: {{ grand_total }}\n"
"</pre>\n"
"\n"
"<h4>Kaip rasti laukų pavadinimus</h4>\n"
"\n"
"<p>El. laiško šablone galite naudoti dokumento, iš kurio siunčiate laišką, laukų pavadinimus. Bet kurio dokumento laukus rasite pasirinkę Nustatymai &gt; Tinkinti formos rodinį ir dokumento tipą (pvz., Pardavimo sąskaita faktūra)</p>\n"
"\n"
"<h4>Šablonai</h4>\n"
"\n"
"<p>Šablonai apdorojami naudojant Jinja šablonų kalbą. Daugiau apie Jinja sužinosite <a class=\"strong\" href=\"http://jinja.pocoo.org/docs/dev/templates/\">perskaitę šią dokumentaciją.</a></p>"

msgid ""
"<h4>Standard Terms and Conditions Example</h4>\n"
"\n"
"<pre>Delivery Terms for Order number {{ name }}\n"
"\n"
"-Order Date : {{ transaction_date }} \n"
"-Expected Delivery Date : {{ delivery_date }}\n"
"</pre>\n"
"\n"
"<h4>How to get fieldnames</h4>\n"
"\n"
"<p>The fieldnames you can use in your email template are the fields in the document from which you are sending the email. You can find out the fields of any documents via Setup &gt; Customize Form View and selecting the document type (e.g. Sales Invoice)</p>\n"
"\n"
"<h4>Templating</h4>\n"
"\n"
"<p>Templates are compiled using the Jinja Templating Language. To learn more about Jinja, <a class=\"strong\" href=\"http://jinja.pocoo.org/docs/dev/templates/\">read this documentation.</a></p>"
msgstr ""
"<h4>Standartinių sąlygų pavyzdys</h4>\n"
"\n"
"<pre>Užsakymo Nr. {{ name }} pristatymo sąlygos\n"
"\n"
"-Užsakymo data: {{ transaction_date }} \n"
"-Numatoma pristatymo data: {{ delivery_date }}\n"
"</pre>\n"
"\n"
"<h4>Kaip rasti laukų pavadinimus</h4>\n"
"\n"
"<p>El. laiško šablone galite naudoti dokumento, iš kurio siunčiate el. laišką, laukų pavadinimus. Bet kurio dokumento laukus galite rasti pasirinkę Sąranka &gt; Tinkinti formos rodinį ir dokumento tipą (pvz., Pardavimo sąskaita faktūra)</p>\n"
"\n"
"<h4>Šablonai</h4>\n"
"\n"
"<p>Šablonai kompiliuojami naudojant Jinja šablonų kalbą. Norėdami sužinoti daugiau apie Jinja, <a class=\"strong\" href=\"http://jinja.pocoo.org/docs/dev/templates/\">skaitykite šią dokumentaciją.</a></p>"

